NOM & Primary driver / agent & Source of action policies & Softmax
policy over \(G{(\pi)}\); highest epistemic value \\
ACC & Primary target / patient & Object of predictions & Predicted
distribution \(Z_{\text{acc}}\); error-driven update \\
GEN & Source / possessor & Provider of priors & Prior return
distribution \(p(Z)\) \\
DAT & Recipient / goal & Target of information transfer & EIG maximised
toward DAT state \\
INS & Instrument / means & Tool for state transformation & IQN risk
distortion (neutral mode) \\
LOC & Context / environment & Markov blanket boundary & Bethe FE
boundary conditions \\
ABL & Origin / cause & Source of causal influence & Push-forward source
measure \(\mathbb{P}_{x_0,a_0}\) \\
VOC & Addressee & Pragmatic pointer & Lowest epistemic weight; largest
P600 on violation \\
\bottomrule\noalign{}
\end{longtable}
}
\end{block}
